               "<h3>Legal, Safety, and Compliance Reasons</h3>" +
               "<p>Information may be disclosed if required by law, legal process, court order, regulatory request, or when reasonably necessary to enforce policies, respond to security issues, or protect rights.</p>" +
               "<h3>Business Transfers</h3>" +
               "<p>Information may be transferred or reviewed as part of a merger, acquisition, financing, reorganization, sale of assets, or similar business transaction involving RehabNavigator.</p>" +
               "<div class=\"soft-box\">RehabNavigator does not share a user’s personal contact information with providers based only on searches, filters, page views, or provider profile activity.</div>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "providers",
        NavLabel = "External Providers",
        Title = "Treatment Providers and External Websites",
        Body = "<p>RehabNavigator may display provider contact information and website links within facility profiles.</p>" +
               "<p>When a user chooses to contact a provider, visit a provider’s website, or use a service outside RehabNavigator, any information the user shares is provided directly to that provider or third-party service and is subject to that party’s own privacy practices.</p>" +
               "<p>RehabNavigator does not control how external providers, third-party websites, phone systems, or linked services collect, use, store, or protect information.</p>"
    },
    new()
