               "</ul>" +
               "<p>Transactional, service-related, or legally required communications may still be sent when necessary.</p>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "requests",
        NavLabel = "Privacy Requests",
        Title = "Privacy Requests",
        Body = "<p>You may contact RehabNavigator to ask about personal information you have submitted through our website, such as a Contact Us message, provider listing request, claim request, listing update request, advertising inquiry, or Plans &amp; Pricing inquiry.</p>" +
               "<p>Depending on the type of information involved and applicable law, you may request that we review, correct, update, or stop using information you submitted to us.</p>" +
               "<p>For privacy and security protection, we may need to verify a request before making changes or sharing information about records associated with you.</p>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "security",
        NavLabel = "Data Security",
        Title = "Data Security",
        Body = "<p>RehabNavigator uses reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards intended to help protect information submitted through the website.</p>" +
               "<p>No internet transmission, website, email system, form tool, or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure. Users should avoid submitting highly sensitive information through general website forms.</p>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "retention",
        NavLabel = "Data Retention",
        Title = "Data Retention",
        Body = "<p>RehabNavigator may retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to operate the website, respond to inquiries, maintain business records, support provider listings, improve services, maintain security, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce policies.</p>" +
               "<p>Retention periods may vary based on the type of information, the reason it was collected, legal requirements, and operational needs.</p>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "children",
        NavLabel = "Children’s Privacy",
        Title = "Children’s Privacy",
        Body = "<p>RehabNavigator is not directed to children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly request personal information from children under 13.</p>" +
               "<p>General website forms are intended for adults and authorized representatives.</p>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "international",
        NavLabel = "International Users",
        Title = "International Users",
        Body = "<p>RehabNavigator may be accessed from different locations. If users access the website from outside the United States, they understand that information may be processed, transferred, or stored in the United States or other jurisdictions where our service providers operate.</p>" +
               "<p>Privacy laws may differ depending on the user’s location. RehabNavigator will handle privacy requests as required by applicable law.</p>"
    },
    new()
    {
        Id = "updates",
        NavLabel = "Policy Updates",
        Title = "Changes to This Privacy Policy",
        Body = "<p>RehabNavigator may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in website features, data practices, legal requirements, or business operations.</p>" +
               "<p>Updated versions will be posted on this page with a revised effective date.</p>"
